OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 FEB
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GHandel's Dixit Dominus, Nisi
OL,6,     GDominus and Salve Regina
OL,7,     Gperformed by soloists with the
OL,8,     GHungarian Radio Chorus and
OL,9,     GHungarian Radio Symphony
OL,10,     GOrchestra in the Matthias Church,
OL,11,     GBudapest.
OL,12,G0630FBreakfast
OL,13,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,17,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,18,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,19,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,20,     Gwith familiar favourites.
