OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GKlaus Makela conducts the Royal
OL,6,     GConcertgebouw Orchestra in
OL,7,     GMahler's 5th Symphony and
OL,8,     GAlexander Gavryluk plays Grieg's
OL,9,     GPiano Concerto. Plus Beethoven's
OL,10,     G'Pathetique' Sonata.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,12,     GRachmaninov's final years are
OL,13,     Gspent on American Soil - in
OL,14,     GHollywood - sheltering from the
OL,15,     Gwar in Europe.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,18,     GDowland's Foundry - performing
OL,19,     Glive to mark the 400th
OL,20,     Ganniversary of Dowland's death.
OL,21,     GGeorgia Shackleton is also live
OL,22,     Gin studio with Aaren Bennett.
